== Core Ethical Principles
1. Impact on users
2. Trust and reputation
3. Legal implications
4. Innovation and sustainability
5. Professional growth
6. Social responsibility

== Product Lifecycle
1. Inception
2. Design and development
3. Verification and validation
4. Deployment
5. Operation and monitoring
6. Re-evaluation
7. Retirement

== AI Applications
- EdTech
- Healthcare
- FinTech
- Generative AI

== Business Model
Economic, environmental and societal value

== Dark Patterns
Deceptive design patterns benefiting company at user expense:
1. *Fake urgency*: "only n items left"
2. *Sneak into basket*: adding items without consent
3. *Hidden costs*: unexpected costs at last step
4. *Forced continuity*: difficult cancellation
5. *Confirmshaming*: guilt manipulation
6. *Roach motel*: easy sign up, hard exit

